WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,500
The pharmacy is down there. The water is too deep. There's no need to risk it.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,710
Forget about large medical equipment

3
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:10,740
Just choose small instruments that can be used, such as a bowel removal instrument, a blood pressure oximeter, etc.

4
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:14,410
Medical books collection

5
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:17,410
Good Chinese medicinal materials. Take away everything related to Chinese medicine.

6
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:19,410
You will learn these slowly later and they will come in handy in time.

7
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:29,420
Isolation suit, gas mask, biochemical protective suit

8
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:38,620
Even if you have money outside, you may not be able to buy these things and take them away.

9
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:50,740
senior nursing home

10
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:53,740
It was not painted or watered, so it could still burn when it was steamed and lacked fuel.

11
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:56,740
It would be too much of a waste if such a good table were burned. Let’s save a few sets for use first.
